	 	SCOPE.HL
 
 
	SCOPE IS AN EDITING PROGRAM RUNNING UNDER OS-8.
	FOR CREATION OF NEW FILES OR MODIFICATION OF EXISTING FILES.
 
	COMMAND DECODER LINE:
	
	    *DEV:NEWNAM.EX<DEV:OLDNAM.EX
	
	OR,
	    *DEV:NEWNAM.EX<DEV:OLDNM1.EX,OLDNM2.EX
	WHICH MERGES THE INPUT FILES,IN ORDER SPECIFIED.
	
	CURRENT LINE NUMBER (OCTAL) IN BRACKETS AT LOWER RIGHT.
	
	  LINE FEED COMMANDS:
 
	  	NNN  WILL GO TO LINE SPECIFIED
	  	CL  CLEARS ENTIRE BUFFER
	  	EX  NORMAL EXIT TO MONITOR WITH FILE SAVED
 
	  EDITING OPERATIONS:
 
		CTRL/C  RETURN TO MONITOR;PREEMPTIVE
		CTRL/I  TAB SPACING (8 SPACES)
 
	  	CTRL/E  ADVANCE 1 SPACE
	  	CTRL/W  ADVANCE 1 LINE
	  	CTRL/Q  ADVANCE 1 FRAME
 
	  	CTRL/D  BACKSPACE 1 SPACE
	  	CTRL/S  BACKSPACE 1 LINE
	  	CTRL/A  BACKSPACE 1 FRAME
 
	  	RUBOUT  DELETE 1 CHARACTER
	  	CTRL/L  DELETE 1 LINE
	 	CTRL/P  DELETE 1 FRAME	
 
 
	  AD 3 CONTROLS NUMBER OF LINES IN DISPLAY
	
	  THE MANUSCRIPT WORKING AREA IS ALWAYS SAVED ON LEAVING SCOPE.
			23 SEPT 1975  R. WADE
-1		END
